14. FAILURE MATRIX

  | Failure | Server truth | Client temp state | Recovery | False success? | Privacy leak? |
  |---------|-------------|-----------------|----------|---------------|---------------|
  | Transport unavailable | committed | stale (last REST fetch) | manual refresh | No (REST still works) | No (no payload) |
  | Publish unavailable | committed | stale | reconnect refresh | No | No |
  | Duplicate event | committed | refetch (idempotent) | dedup via eventId | No | No |
  | Stale event | committed | refetch (server truth wins) | N/A | No | No |
  | Unauthorized subscription | N/A | no event received | N/A | No | No (auth check) |
  | Auth changes while connected | committed | refetch (re-evaluated) | reconnect re-auth | No | No (delivery check) |
  | Reconnect after missed events | committed | stale → refetch | REST reconciles | No | No |
  | Server restart | committed | stale → reconnect → refetch | REST reconciles | No | No |

